      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW GUSTO (3) is better than last start when fourth (25.48) from Box 3 at this track over 435m. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from seven starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. DR. CALISTA (1) finished seventh last time but the start prior broke the clock when winning over 435m at this track, taking a Restricted WIN in an excellent 24.25. Has the ability and looks a key chance. WAX OFF (2) held a forward position from the pinch but began to paddle on the bend and drifted out of the finish when 6th at Warragul in Grade 4/5 company. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from five starts. In the mix. FULL NOISE (5) profiles nicely over this trip.",
